# Prettier formats the application and its tooling config, and nothing else.
# Everything outside that is the Blueprint delivery harness (scripts/, hooks/,
# .claude/, .github/, docs/, website/, the root *.md files, ...), which keeps
# its own conventions and gates and must never be rewritten by `make format`.
#
# So this file is an ALLOWLIST: ignore every top-level entry, then re-include
# the application trees and the root config files by name. A new top-level
# directory stays out of Prettier's reach until someone adds it here on purpose.
/*
!/packages/
!/apps/
!/package.json
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
!/tsconfig*.json
!/*.config.js
!/*.config.ts

# Build output inside the application trees (also in .gitignore, which Prettier
# reads too — repeated here so this file alone states the scope).
dist/
coverage/

# The vendored FURS schemas are pinned byte-for-byte by SHA-256 (see
# packages/furs/schemas/README.md). Prettier has no XML parser today, but an XML
# plugin added later would reformat them and break every pin.
packages/furs/schemas/*.xsd
